    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gohery Properties are delighted to bring to the market this impressive ground floor 2 bed apartment in beautiful condition located in the very popular Gleann Mhuiris residential development. The apartment is ideally positioned close to the Claregalway and on the Galway side of the village. Close to schools, Lidl, Centra, hotels and Leisure centres and much more. Inside, you will find a spacious living Kitchen Dining area. Both bedrooms are doubles, with the master bedroom en suite. Oil fired central heating. Ready to walk into."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "⭐ 2-bedroom ground floor apartment \r\n⭐ In excellent condition\r\n⭐ Extends to 68 sq mts (732 sq. Ft.) accommodation\r\n⭐Modern internal finishes with new flooring, bathroom and refurbished kitchen\r\n⭐ Managed apartments € 800 p.a.\r\n⭐ Very convenient location close to Claregalway and all amenities including schools, Supervalu, Lidl, Centra, hotels, Leisure centre,"
      },
